SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Page updated: Maine UCC (Uniform Commercial C
 ode) Filing Division
DESCRIPTION:This page's content changed since the last check. Visit the pa
 ge directly to review the update.\n\nWhat changed (text excerpt):\nAdded:\
 n  + & will be closed Monday\, September 7\, 2026.\nRemoved:\n  - & will b
 e closed Friday\, July 3\, 2026.\nhttps://www.maine.gov/sos/corporations-c
